WEBVTT

00:01:29.438 --> 00:01:33.934
„F, G, H, I, J, K...”

00:01:35.104 --> 00:01:39.762
La K a clipit. Am luat-o de la capăt:

00:01:39.766 --> 00:01:46.620
„A, B, C, D, E, F, G, H, I...”

00:01:47.170 --> 00:01:49.641
A clipit din nou la litera I, 


00:01:49.641 --> 00:01:55.512
apoi la T, la R şi la A: KITRA.

00:01:55.512 --> 00:01:59.559
A spus: „Kitra, frumoasa mea, nu plânge !”

00:01:59.559 --> 00:02:03.386
„Aceasta e o binecuvântare”.